<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ARTHUR KAPLAN DETAILS CAP SHARE AWARD.</title>
<headline>ARTHUR KAPLAN DETAILS CAP SHARE AWARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Arthur Kaplan Jewellery Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders representing 75,981 shares had elected to receive a cash payment of 391 cents a share as part of the firm's capitalisation share award.</p>
<p>A total of 458,850 shares had been allotted to the scheme.</p>
<p>Holding firm Smart Centre Holdings will pay out a total of 297,086 rand and the capitalisation shares will be issued on October 16.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
